#: include/defs/uistr.h:277
msgid ""
"IcoWM has reached its configured memory ceiling: using %u MiB of the "
"%u MiB allowed (see the '-M' command-line option).  Close some windows "
"to free up memory before opening more."
msgstr ""

#: include/defs/uistr.h:282
