"no wisdom of the ancients may this day be divined.  Prithee, entreat "
"thy package steward with an incantation such as 'sudo apt install "
"fortune-mod' (or whate'er charm thy distribution demandeth), that the "
"sages of yore might once more speak through this humble dialog."
msgstr ""
